  "overwork_accounting": "Overwork is charged on every rolling window of rolling_window_days (days 1-7, 2-8, 3-9, ... by default; the last window ends at the horizon). In each window, shifts are taken in day order and every shift that takes the student's hours above their cap is one extra shift (with 4 h shifts and a 20 h cap: extra = shifts - floor(20/4)). Extra shifts in a window are priced by the tier table (2, 4, then 6 each) and the student is charged the sum over all their windows. The worst rolling window per student is also reported for information.",
